        {
          "text": "Basebesithi kubo: INkosi izalibona, ilihlulele; ngokuba nenze iphunga lethu laba yisinengiso emehlweni kaFaro nasemehlweni ezinceku zakhe, ukubeka inkemba esandleni sabo ukuba basibulale.",
